  <p>We're based in Neutral Bay on Sydney's Lower North Shore, just across the harbour from the CBD. Every cake is mixed by hand in small batches using real ingredients, and baked for your date. There's no fondant and nothing artificial, just good cake meant to be eaten.</p>
  <p>Because we bake from a home kitchen, there's no shopfront to walk into. Order online and we'll take care of the rest.</p>
</div></section>
